{"1":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِيَوْمِ","d":"biyawmi","e":"by (the) Day"},{"c":"الْقِيَامَةِ","d":"l-qiyāmati","e":"(of) the Resurrection"}],"a":{"g":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And nay!"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِالنَّفْسِ","d":"bil-nafsi","e":"by the soul"},{"c":"اللَّوَّامَةِ","d":"l-lawāmati","e":"self-accusing"}],"a":{"g":"And I swear by the reproaching soul [to the certainty of resurrection]."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"أَيَحْسَبُ","d":"ayaḥsabu","e":"Does think"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[the] man"},{"c":"أَلَّنْ","d":"allan","e":"that not"},{"c":"نَجْمَعَ","d":"najmaʿa","e":"We will assemble"},{"c":"عِظَامَهُ","d":"ʿiẓāmahu","e":"his bones"}],"a":{"g":"Does man think that We will not assemble his bones?"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"بَلَى","d":"balā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"قَادِرِينَ","d":"qādirīna","e":"[We are] able"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"نُسَوِّيَ","d":"nusawwiya","e":"We can restore"},{"c":"بَنَانَهُ","d":"banānahu","e":"his fingertips"}],"a":{"g":"Yes. [We are] Able [even] to proportion his fingertips."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"يُرِيدُ","d":"yurīdu","e":"Desires"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[the] man"},{"c":"لِيَفْجُرَ","d":"liyafjura","e":"to give (the) lie"},{"c":"أَمَامَهُ","d":"amāmahu","e":"(to) what is before him"}],"a":{"g":"But man desires to continue in sin."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"يَسْءَلُ","d":"yasalu","e":"He asks"},{"c":"أَيَّانَ","d":"ayyāna","e":"When"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْقِيَامَةِ","d":"l-qiyāmati","e":"(of) the Resurrection"}],"a":{"g":"He asks, \"When is the Day of Resurrection?\""}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"So when"},{"c":"بَرِقَ","d":"bariqa","e":"is dazzled"},{"c":"الْبَصَرُ","d":"l-baṣaru","e":"the vision"}],"a":{"g":"So when vision is dazzled"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَخَسَفَ","d":"wakhasafa","e":"And becomes dark"},{"c":"الْقَمَرُ","d":"l-qamaru","e":"the moon"}],"a":{"g":"And the moon darkens"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَجُمِعَ","d":"wajumiʿa","e":"And are joined"},{"c":"الشَّمْسُ","d":"l-shamsu","e":"the sun"},{"c":"وَالْقَمَرُ","d":"wal-qamaru","e":"and the moon"}],"a":{"g":"And the sun and the moon are joined,"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"يَقُولُ","d":"yaqūlu","e":"Will say"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[the] man"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"أَيْنَ","d":"ayna","e":"Where"},{"c":"الْمَفَرُّ","d":"l-mafaru","e":"(is) the escape"}],"a":{"g":"Man will say on that Day, \"Where is the [place of] escape?\""}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"By no means!"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(There is) no"},{"c":"وَزَرَ","d":"wazara","e":"refuge"}],"a":{"g":"No! There is no refuge."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"To"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"الْمُسْتَقَرُّ","d":"l-mus'taqaru","e":"(is) the place of rest"}],"a":{"g":"To your Lord, that Day, is the [place of] permanence."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"يُنَبَّؤُا","d":"yunabba-u","e":"Will be informed"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[the] man"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"قَدَّمَ","d":"qaddama","e":"he sent forth"},{"c":"وَأَخَّرَ","d":"wa-akhara","e":"and kept back"}],"a":{"g":"Man will be informed that Day of what he sent ahead and kept back."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"بَلِ","d":"bali","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[The] man"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"against"},{"c":"نَفْسِهِ","d":"nafsihi","e":"himself"},{"c":"بَصِيرَةٌ","d":"baṣīratun","e":"(will be) a witness"}],"a":{"g":"Rather, man, against himself, will be a witness,"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"Even if"},{"c":"أَلْقَى","d":"alqā","e":"he presents"},{"c":"مَعَاذِيرَهُ","d":"maʿādhīrahu","e":"his excuses"}],"a":{"g":"Even if he presents his excuses."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"تُحَرِّكْ","d":"tuḥarrik","e":"move"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with it"},{"c":"لِسَانَكَ","d":"lisānaka","e":"your tongue"},{"c":"لِتَعْجَلَ","d":"litaʿjala","e":"to hasten"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with it"}],"a":{"g":"Move not your tongue with it, [O Muhammad], to hasten with recitation of the Qur'an."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"upon Us"},{"c":"جَمْعَهُ","d":"jamʿahu","e":"(is) its collection"},{"c":"وَقُرْءَانَهُ","d":"waqur'ānahu","e":"and its recitation"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, upon Us is its collection [in your heart] and [to make possible] its recitation."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"قَرَأْنَاهُ","d":"qaranāhu","e":"We have recited it"},{"c":"فَاتَّبِعْ","d":"fa-ittabiʿ","e":"then follow"},{"c":"قُرْءَانَهُ","d":"qur'ānahu","e":"its recitation"}],"a":{"g":"So when We have recited it [through Gabriel], then follow its recitation."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"indeed"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"upon Us"},{"c":"بَيَانَهُ","d":"bayānahu","e":"(is) its explanation"}],"a":{"g":"Then upon Us is its clarification [to you]."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"No!"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"But"},{"c":"تُحِبُّونَ","d":"tuḥibbūna","e":"you love"},{"c":"الْعَاجِلَةَ","d":"l-ʿājilata","e":"the immediate"}],"a":{"g":"No! But you love the immediate"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَذَرُونَ","d":"watadharūna","e":"And leave"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةَ","d":"l-ākhirata","e":"the Hereafter"}],"a":{"g":"And leave the Hereafter."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وُجُوهٌ","d":"wujūhun","e":"Faces"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"نَاضِرَةٌ","d":"nāḍiratun","e":"(will be) radiant"}],"a":{"g":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant,"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"Towards"},{"c":"رَبِّهَا","d":"rabbihā","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"نَاظِرَةٌ","d":"nāẓiratun","e":"looking"}],"a":{"g":"Looking at their Lord."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَوُجُوهٌ","d":"wawujūhun","e":"And faces"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"بَاسِرَةٌ","d":"bāsiratun","e":"(will be) distorted"}],"a":{"g":"And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted,"}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"تَظُنُّ","d":"taẓunnu","e":"Thinking"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يُفْعَلَ","d":"yuf'ʿala","e":"will be done"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"to them"},{"c":"فَاقِرَةٌ","d":"fāqiratun","e":"backbreaking"}],"a":{"g":"Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"No!"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"بَلَغَتِ","d":"balaghati","e":"it reaches"},{"c":"التَّرَاقِيَ","d":"l-tarāqiya","e":"the collar bones"}],"a":{"g":"No! When the soul has reached the collar bones"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَقِيلَ","d":"waqīla","e":"And it is said"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Who"},{"c":"رَاقٍ","d":"rāqin","e":"(will) cure"}],"a":{"g":"And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]?\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَظَنَّ","d":"waẓanna","e":"And he is certain"},{"c":"أَنَّهُ","d":"annahu","e":"that it"},{"c":"الْفِرَاقُ","d":"l-firāqu","e":"(is) the parting"}],"a":{"g":"And the dying one is certain that it is the [time of] separation"}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْتَفَّتِ","d":"wal-tafati","e":"And is wound"},{"c":"السَّاقُ","d":"l-sāqu","e":"the leg"},{"c":"بِالسَّاقِ","d":"bil-sāqi","e":"about the leg"}],"a":{"g":"And the leg is wound about the leg,"}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"To"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"الْمَسَاقُ","d":"l-masāqu","e":"(will be) the driving"}],"a":{"g":"To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"And not"},{"c":"صَدَّقَ","d":"ṣaddaqa","e":"he accepted (the) truth"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"صَلَّى","d":"ṣallā","e":"he prayed"}],"a":{"g":"And the disbeliever had not believed, nor had he prayed."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"But"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"he denied"},{"c":"وَتَوَلَّى","d":"watawallā","e":"and turned away"}],"a":{"g":"But [instead], he denied and turned away."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"ذَهَبَ","d":"dhahaba","e":"he went"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"أَهْلِهِ","d":"ahlihi","e":"his family"},{"c":"يَتَمَطَّى","d":"yatamaṭṭā","e":"swaggering"}],"a":{"g":"And then he went to his people, swaggering [in pride]."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"أَوْلَى","d":"awlā","e":"Woe"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"to you"},{"c":"فَأَوْلَى","d":"fa-awlā","e":"and woe!"}],"a":{"g":"Woe to you, and woe!"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"أَوْلَى","d":"awlā","e":"woe"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"to you"},{"c":"فَأَوْلَى","d":"fa-awlā","e":"and woe!"}],"a":{"g":"Then woe to you, and woe!"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"أَيَحْسَبُ","d":"ayaḥsabu","e":"Does think"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يُتْرَكَ","d":"yut'raka","e":"he will be left"},{"c":"سُدًى","d":"sudan","e":"neglected"}],"a":{"g":"Does man think that he will be left neglected?"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Was not"},{"c":"يَكُ","d":"yaku","e":"he"},{"c":"نُطْفَةً","d":"nuṭ'fatan","e":"a sperm"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَنِيٍّ","d":"maniyyin","e":"semen"},{"c":"يُمْنَى","d":"yum'nā","e":"emitted"}],"a":{"g":"Had he not been a sperm from semen emitted?"}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he was"},{"c":"عَلَقَةً","d":"ʿalaqatan","e":"a clinging substance"},{"c":"فَخَلَقَ","d":"fakhalaqa","e":"then He created"},{"c":"فَسَوَّى","d":"fasawwā","e":"and proportioned"}],"a":{"g":"Then he was a clinging clot, and [Allah] created [his form] and proportioned [him]"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَجَعَلَ","d":"fajaʿala","e":"Then made"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"of him"},{"c":"الزَّوْجَيْنِ","d":"l-zawjayni","e":"two mates"},{"c":"الذَّكَرَ","d":"l-dhakara","e":"(the) male"},{"c":"وَالْأُنْثَى","d":"wal-unthā","e":"and the female"}],"a":{"g":"And made of him two mates, the male and the female."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَيْسَ","d":"alaysa","e":"Is not"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"[that]"},{"c":"بِقَادِرٍ","d":"biqādirin","e":"(He) Able"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[over]"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"to"},{"c":"يُحْيِيَ","d":"yuḥ'yiya","e":"give life"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَى","d":"l-mawtā","e":"(to) the dead"}],"a":{"g":"Is not that [Creator] Able to give life to the dead?"}}}